{"lines":[{"w":0.30498380025227861,"c":1,"x":0.0076787393000124857,"t":"@MirsIELTS","h":0.036538844825947159,"y":0.0030922081012348945},{"c":1,"w":0.12114990234375002,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.088295685265891558,"y":0.046511628102355207,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"t":"JAKE:","h":0.0087209302063888661,"y":0.094476744167985016,"w":0.043121150334676117,"c":1,"x":0.088295687600335765},{"h":0.010174418761666915,"x":0.090349077983700066,"y":0.12499999975191844,"w":0.051334698994954436,"c":1,"t":"CLARE:"},{"w":0.043121150334676103,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.086242299473319031,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"y":0.14098837189232316},{"h":0.010174418761666915,"t":"CLARE:","x":0.090349075971180123,"y":0.17151162778222151,"w":0.049281314214070629,"c":1},{"y":0.18604651176533638,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.0862422999492721,"w":0.045174538294474292,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"x":0.090288754965678994,"h":0.010483758076805572,"w":0.051455345153808577,"c":1,"y":0.2324034696742634,"t":"CLARE:"},{"h":0.011254188515092078,"c":1,"x":0.090137520677682936,"t":"CLARE:","y":0.30033220804012584,"w":0.049704424540201825},{"t":"JAKE:","y":0.33139534857020969,"w":0.043121150334676103,"c":1,"x":0.086242299729992547,"h":0.011627907316944963},{"h":0.010174418761667026,"y":0.34738372081780988,"x":0.090349075911445198,"w":0.049281314214070643,"c":1,"t":"CLARE:"},{"y":0.36337209301211559,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"c":1,"x":0.090349075458190833,"w":0.036960986455281578,"t":"JAKE:"},{"h":0.011627907316944963,"x":0.088295689582171946,"w":0.053388086954752598,"t":"CLARE:","y":0.37790697652563598,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.4244186045472188,"x":0.086242299478452508,"w":0.043121150334676103,"h":0.010174418761666915},{"w":0.049324906667073565,"x":0.09032727962343387,"t":"CLARE:","h":0.010280729535758315,"c":1,"y":0.44035382125721434},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"y":0.48691860464002268,"x":0.090349075517762431,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079753,"t":"JAKE:"},{"y":0.50140724095067424,"x":0.09033009944156746,"c":1,"t":"CLARE:","w":0.049319267272949205,"h":0.010266913354924245},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.088295687503796308,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.53343023254827437,"w":0.041067762374877928},{"w":0.049412212371826178,"c":1,"h":0.010496777559803605,"x":0.090283626771247252,"y":0.54780393677962536,"t":"CLARE:"},{"w":0.043121150334676103,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.56395348826814906,"x":0.086242299478452508,"h":0.010174418761666915},{"c":1,"w":0.0494481372833252,"h":0.010586964204951421,"y":0.59427047136384026,"x":0.090265664315578226,"t":"CLARE:"},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.088295687498392658,"y":0.61046511627035205,"w":0.041067762374877928,"t":"JAKE:","c":1},{"y":0.65552325568919823,"x":0.088295687955440058,"w":0.051334702173868804,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"t":"CLARE:"},{"x":0.086242299478452508,"w":0.043121150334676103,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"y":0.70203488352176024,"t":"JAKE:"},{"y":0.092920353809665346,"x":0.18891170937289406,"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"Mmm. That might be rather broad. Maybe just look at the effects of one","c":1,"w":0.56262832641601568},{"x":0.18480492798638798,"y":0.1090116281122252,"c":1,"t":"supplement, like sugar, on the health of the mice?","w":0.39835728963216149,"h":0.014587191916496711},{"w":0.60985626220703126,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"t":"In fact, maybe the focus could be on whether mice can control their own diet.","y":0.12354651183104981,"x":0.18480492818411667},{"c":1,"x":0.18891171120524528,"y":0.13952802375363349,"w":0.62012318929036458,"h":0.013088255575624541,"t":"So, what happens when they have access to more sugar, that they don't really"},{"t":"Exactly. Do they eat it or do they decide to leave it?","x":0.18685831003490611,"y":0.1699115045781241,"w":0.40862424214680987,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.18891171198759499,"h":0.013081395872223012,"w":0.64476384480794269,"t":"Great. Then later on, you could do a follow-up experiment adding another variable.","y":0.18604651136407657},{"y":0.20203488354847599,"w":0.6365502929687501,"c":1,"h":0.011627907316944963,"t":"Like, you could give some of the mice the chance to be more active, running on a","x":0.18685832361347271},{"w":0.55030802408854163,"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"wheel or something, and the others just sit around and don't do much.","c":1,"x":0.18480492010608279,"y":0.21651917405074883},{"y":0.23080241159637427,"h":0.014991387786415178,"x":0.1888409810215535,"w":0.61408721923828113,"t":"Or I could repeat the experiment but change the type of food I provided ... or","c":1},{"y":0.24854651145564532,"w":0.62217661539713554,"h":0.011630479705720509,"x":0.18685830410001708,"c":1,"t":"use mice with a different genetic structure. But I think your idea would be more"},{"w":0.37782341003417963,"h":0.014534883302221524,"t":"interesting, I might think about that some more.","x":0.18480492727695538,"y":0.26308139555237764,"c":1},{"y":0.29941002975782216,"h":0.013089970501474868,"x":0.18685830383828603,"w":0.61396306355794272,"c":1,"t":"So can I talk through a possible procedure for the experiment where mice are"},{"y":0.31533923296651234,"c":1,"t":"given a sugar supplement?","h":0.013274336283185972,"w":0.21971252441406253,"x":0.18480492865841142},{"y":0.3299418601999069,"w":0.40041066487630217,"h":0.013125986194891803,"c":1,"t":"Sure. I did a similar experiment in college actually.","x":0.18685832248611647},{"c":1,"w":0.32256668090820306,"t":"Great. So how many mice would I need?","x":0.18880903318285458,"y":0.3444186719821245,"h":0.013933877185382637},{"t":"I'd say about 12. And all young ones, not a mixture of old and young.","y":0.36046511647670232,"h":0.014534883302221635,"x":0.18480493234185588,"w":0.54620122273763017,"c":1},{"x":0.18891169914407063,"w":0.64065709431966145,"y":0.3764011800566549,"h":0.01327433628318575,"c":1,"t":"OK. And I'd need two groups of equal sizes, so six in each group. And how would"},{"t":"I tell them apart? I suppose I could put some sort of tag on one group... or just","w":0.63449691772460937,"c":1,"h":0.013274336283185861,"x":0.18685831715976928,"y":0.39233038326820124},{"h":0.014557179026195799,"x":0.18480492816883726,"t":"mark them in some way?","w":0.20328542073567707,"c":1,"y":0.40697674438530718},{"w":0.43121149698893235,"c":1,"t":"You could use food colouring, that wouldn't hurt them.","x":0.18480492901179615,"y":0.4229651164846191,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"w":0.64681727091471353,"x":0.18685830489171915,"c":1,"t":"Perfect. Then each group would go into a separate cage, and one group, let's call","y":0.43893805321301715,"h":0.013096830767516332},{"w":0.620269775390625,"x":0.18473032217842672,"y":0.4522959623435816,"c":1,"h":0.017382438907229458,"t":"them group A, would be the control group. So they'd just have ordinary mouse"},{"y":0.46947674401150796,"h":0.011644199675163391,"c":1,"w":0.27104723612467452,"x":0.18685831201901457,"t":"food. I suppose you can buy that?"},{"w":0.2197125244140625,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"y":0.48401162817819321,"x":0.1868583163583972,"t":"Yes, it comes in dry pellets."},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"w":0.64065709431966145,"t":"And the other group would have the same as the first group, but they'd also have","c":1,"x":0.18685831104850117,"y":0.50000000020689073},{"w":0.12525667826334633,"t":"the extra sugar.","x":0.18685831373958986,"h":0.011799410029498469,"c":1,"y":0.51592920359539207},{"t":"Would you just give them straight sugar?","y":0.53038348055966622,"w":0.32648869832356769,"h":0.014749262536873142,"x":0.18480493204906528,"c":1},{"t":"It might be better to give them something like cereal with it.","y":0.54651162811310106,"h":0.014550318760154557,"c":1,"w":0.46817250569661456,"x":0.18480491747977851},{"y":0.56100852749952645,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. Then you'd need to weigh the mice, I should think once a week. And you'd","x":0.18474135570920908,"w":0.64487436930338538,"h":0.01675304536622535},{"h":0.015441175477694635,"y":0.57480437643705695,"w":0.22223393758138021,"t":"need an electronic balance.","c":1,"x":0.18666913564993393},{"x":0.186801669115052,"y":0.59104798905293587,"w":0.50730555216471351,"t":"But we can't hold them on the balance, or it'd affect the reading.","h":0.016269026112064155,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Exactly. So you need something called a weighing chamber to stop the mice from","h":0.014565754218087368,"x":0.1848049160170899,"y":0.60755813972405071,"w":0.64681727091471353},{"x":0.18480491629876308,"t":"running away. It sounds complicated, but actually you can just use a plastic box","w":0.63039016723632812,"h":0.014534883302221524,"y":0.6235465118342457,"c":1},{"x":0.18668523716136462,"w":0.1666946283976237,"h":0.013203337340228272,"y":0.63814337406245747,"t":"with holes in the top.","c":1},{"x":0.18480492237803001,"w":0.62422999064127604,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"y":0.65398230080256148,"t":"OK. So once we've measured the weight gain of each mouse we can work out"},{"y":0.66991150467090954,"x":0.18480492806968962,"w":0.60164271036783856,"c":1,"t":"the average for each group, as well as the standard deviation. And then see","h":0.01327433628318575},{"t":"where we go from there. That sounds cool, I think the students will enjoy it.","w":0.59137578328450524,"x":0.18685830948893767,"y":0.68604651136388639,"h":0.013081395872223012,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.69965123609499369,"w":0.15060293833414712,"t":"Yes. One thing ...","x":0.18650888253248515,"h":0.014755490958514916},{"y":0.74963127088206027,"w":0.10492207845052084,"t":"PART 4","x":0.088196044862912826,"h":0.015272341927947575,"c":1},{"t":"In today's lecture, I'm going to be talking about microplastics.","w":0.48665298461914064,"x":0.088295684173177541,"h":0.013095115841665783,"y":0.77905604720780486,"c":1},{"t":"Microplastics are tiny pieces of plastic smaller than five millimetres in size. Recently there's","x":0.090349085480327454,"w":0.70225870768229159,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"y":0.80232558122353326},{"c":1,"t":"been a greater awareness that there are large quantities of plastic waste - big and small - in","y":0.81681415903394794,"w":0.718685811360677,"x":0.088295698149676596,"h":0.01327433628318575},{"t":"the environment. The amount of plastic waste in the oceans has received widespread attention,","x":0.088191606443551784,"c":1,"w":0.74154973347981779,"h":0.018882578171811604,"y":0.8285505505990074},{"t":"but far less is known about the effects of microplastics in freshwater and particularly in soil.","h":0.013088255575624541,"c":1,"w":0.70431213378906254,"y":0.84738372066599466,"x":0.088295678360304539},{"c":1,"t":"Microplastics can enter the environment via a number of different sources. Threads and","x":0.090349078740466854,"y":0.87050147464844818,"w":0.69199178059895838,"h":0.01327433628318575},{"t":"microfibres detach from synthetic clothing every time they're put in a washing machine, and","w":0.72706288655598961,"h":0.018861748124294198,"c":1,"y":0.88393710651193047,"x":0.086170644962942619},{"t":"112","c":1,"x":0.088295687367841755,"y":0.92005813979949325,"w":0.036960986455281578,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"y":0.12500000026247216,"t":"Q24","c":1,"x":0.85626283322367158,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Q25","h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711,"y":0.20203488398553981,"x":0.85626283322937546},{"w":0.039014374415079711,"t":"Q26","y":0.36191860491123018,"h":0.013081394746943698,"x":0.85626283323008845,"c":1},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"y":0.40843023282061164,"w":0.039014374415079711,"t":"Q27","x":0.85626283323575048},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.85626283316443541,"t":"Q28","y":0.54651162816944887},{"x":0.85420944507408647,"w":0.036960986455281564,"y":0.61191860491363492,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q29","c":1},{"w":0.039014374415079711,"c":1,"x":0.85420944513973951,"y":0.65843023281820712,"t":"Q30","h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Q31","h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.85420944506804708,"y":0.88662790723681173,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1},{"y":0.94166666659226195,"w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218665204,"h":0.04166666666666663}],"w":2400,"h":3390}